    text:"Proofpoint launched its SOC Analyst Agent, built on OpenAI's cyber-tuned Daybreak models through the Daybreak Defense Network it joined in June, turning natural-language questions into source-linked investigation findings across alerts, logs and DLP events -- in private preview now, broader availability expected by end of Q3.",
